# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Planning documents stay on this machine.
#
# CLAUDE.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, ROADMAP.md and DESIGN.md are the working plan —
# body data, timings, phase-by-phase intentions. They live next to the code,
# not on GitHub.
#
# README.md is the one exception: a repo with no readme is unreadable to
# anyone, including me in a year.
#
# NOTE: this only affects UNTRACKED files. Docs that were already committed
# have to be untracked once with `git rm --cached <file>` before this takes
# effect on them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.md
!README.md

# Health records — blood work, body composition scans, prescriptions. These
# are the reason the app exists, and they must never be pushed anywhere.
*.pdf
/health/

# macOS finder droppings.
.DS_Store
